{"title": "Scar of the Dunes", "pageid": 28153, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Scar_of_the_Dunes", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Buff.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Generic_Buff.webp/300px-Generic_Buff.webp, /w/images/0/02/Generic_Buff.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Generic_Buff.webp/300px-Generic_Buff.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Generic_Buff.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Scar of the Dunes</b> is a passive feature found only on <a href=\"/wiki/Tactician\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tactician\">Tactician</a> difficulty.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>This character's <a href=\"/wiki/Movement_speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement speed\">movement speed</a> is doubled and it cannot be targeted by <a href=\"/wiki/Opportunity_Attack\" title=\"Opportunity Attack\">attacks of opportunity</a>, if its <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\">hit points</a> are lower than 90%. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Dominica_Arsetz\" title=\"Dominica Arsetz\">Dominica Arsetz</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gandrel\" title=\"Gandrel\">Gandrel</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gur_Hunter_Sharpshooter\" title=\"Gur Hunter Sharpshooter\">Gur Hunter Sharpshooter</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Oliver_Quarlic\" title=\"Oliver Quarlic\">Oliver Quarlic</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<p>Found only on <a href=\"/wiki/Tactician\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tactician\">Tactician</a> difficulty.\n</p>\n</div>     \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714232858\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.022 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.026 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 458/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1785/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1098/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 10/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 379/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.003/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643666/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   22.582      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   22.582      1 -total\n 39.77%    8.981      1 Template:Main_namespace_only\n 18.07%    4.080      1 Template:PageSeo\n 16.76%    3.785      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 14.06%    3.176      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n 11.78%    2.660      3 Template:IfEmpty\n  8.04%    1.816      1 Template:Passive_creatures_list\n  6.04%    1.365      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n  1.52%    0.344      1 Template:Clear\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28153-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714232858 and revision id 257899. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}